# 忽略构建阶段部署到公共脚本目录的 Python 运行时，仅保留受版本控制的引擎脚本。
# Ignore the Python runtime deployed into the common script directory while keeping versioned engine scripts.
*
!.gitignore
!PyScript/
!PyScript/**

# PyScript 源码需要纳入版本控制，但运行时生成的字节码必须继续忽略。
# PyScript sources are versioned, while runtime-generated bytecode must remain ignored.
PyScript/**/__pycache__/
PyScript/**/*.py[cod]
